&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;description&#34;&gt;Description&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;description&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#description&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;DROP BROADCAST TABLE RULE&lt;/code&gt; syntax is used to drop broadcast table rule for specified broadcast tables&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;syntax&#34;&gt;Syntax&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;syntax&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#syntax&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;


